      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW HART (1) boasts a consistent overall record including four wins from 16 starts, but missed the frame latest when fourth (26.07) over 457m at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Rates highly here and will go close. LUMEAH ZIGGY (2) finished second (26.01) two back at Gunnedah but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Has the ability to give this a shake. BUNRATTY MAC (7) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for two wins and three minors. Was out of the placings last time (20.53) at Goulburn in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 10 lengths. Looks a key chance on best figures. SLIPPERY EDGE (6) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
